{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791013920, "covers_from": "2026-10-03T07:52:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-03T07:53:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791013980, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-03T07:52:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 25067, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "shilin", "topic": "環境", "content": "市長，你知道嗎？這城市地上很多老鼠蟑螂就算了，天上還ㄧ堆鴿子，到處鴿子大便，走一走還有死鴿子掉下來！", "display_name": "士林代表 PagyChen", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T07:52:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 13587, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "市政", "content": "未來的沈伯洋市長希望你當上台北市長後\n能加速萬華區都更萬華區是舊城區50歲老房子過多對於居住真的擔心", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.13,587", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T07:52:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 20565, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "環境", "content": "富民路到涵洞出來的河堤，早市各種違停、流動攤販無人管理，1999多次，警察局跟市場處互推，真的ㄏ", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.20,565", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-03T07:52:45+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 3532, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "觀光", "content": "一位住在台北市 40多年的市民，發現台生活周遭的都市美學似乎一年不如一年，說真的高雄還比較像國際首都", "display_name": "萬華代表 Eric", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 13587, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.13,587", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 20565, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.20,565", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 3532, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 Eric", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 11314, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_o